<title>POLAND: Polish shares close higher in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares close higher in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thirteen stocks rose, two fell and four were flat in 25-million-zloty Warsaw bourse continuous trade with the WIG 20 index closing at 1,633.4 points, 1.9 percent higher than at the regular session.</p>
<p>The remaining four stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>NFI units fell 0.6 percent in a 33.3-million-zloty turnover.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
